    "title": "JSON Schema for Ocelot.json",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "description": "The gateway forwards any GET request arriving at **/products/{id}** to the downstream service **ProductService** at **https://products.service.local/api/products/{id}**. Requests are treated without case\u2011sensitivity, and the upstream request ID is taken from the header **Request-Id**, while the downstream calls receive an additional header **X-Correlation-ID** populated with the same **{RequestId}** token. The route also injects a claim **UserId** set to **{UserId}**, requires the caller to have the **role** claim equal to **admin**, and automatically appends the query parameter **lang=en**. The route is defined to accept only the GET HTTP method.\n\nFor this route the gateway caches responses for **3600 seconds** in the **us-east-1** region, uses a **RoundRobin** load\u2011balancer, and enforces a circuit\u2011breaker that tolerates **5** exceptions before breaking for **30** seconds, with a request timeout of **10000\u202fms**. Rate limiting is enabled: the client **127.0.0.1** is whitelisted, the limit is **100** requests per **1\u202fm** (a period of **60** seconds). Authentication is handled by the **JwtBearer** provider, and callers must possess the scopes **product.read** and **product.write**. The HTTP handler follows redirects, does not use a cookie container, and enables tracing. The gateway does **not** accept any server certificate without validation, and the global configuration sets the default request\u2011ID header to **X-Request-Id**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "Routes": [
      {
        "DownstreamPathTemplate": "/api/products/{id}",
        "UpstreamPathTemplate": "/products/{id}",
        "UpstreamHttpMethod": [
          "GET"
        ],
        "AddHeadersToRequest": {
          "X-Correlation-ID": "{RequestId}"
        },
        "AddClaimsToRequest": {
          "UserId": "{UserId}"
        },
        "RouteClaimsRequirement": {
          "role": "admin"
        },
        "AddQueriesToRequest": {
          "lang": "en"
        },
        "RequestIdKey": "Request-Id",
        "FileCacheOptions": {
          "TtlSeconds": 3600,
          "Region": "us-east-1"
        },
        "RouteIsCaseSensitive": false,
        "ServiceName": "ProductService",
        "DownstreamScheme": "https",
        "DownstreamHostAndPorts": [
          {
            "Host": "products.service.local",
            "Port": 443
          }
        ],
        "QoSOptions": {
          "ExceptionsAllowedBeforeBreaking": 5,
          "DurationOfBreak": 30,
          "TimeoutValue": 10000
        },
        "LoadBalancer": "RoundRobin",
        "RateLimitOptions": {
          "ClientWhitelist": [
            "127.0.0.1"
          ],
          "EnableRateLimiting": true,
          "Period": "1m",
          "PeriodTimespan": 60,
          "Limit": 100
        },
        "AuthenticationOptions": {
          "AuthenticationProviderKey": "JwtBearer",
          "AllowedScopes": [
            "product.read",
            "product.write"
          ]
        },
        "HttpHandlerOptions": {
          "AllowAutoRedirect": true,
          "UseCookieContainer": false,
          "UseTracing": true
        },
        "DangerousAcceptAnyServerCertificateValidator": false
      }
    ],
    "GlobalConfiguration": {
      "RequestIdKey": "X-Request-Id"
    }
  }
}